        "original_id": "0c3da5e2-1922-5ff6-8fbb-d1186efc288a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dan Lewis\n- Organizations: Arsenal F.C., Cardiff City\n- Places: Highbury, London, England, Wales\n- Roles: Football goalkeeper\n- Events: 1927 FA Cup Final\n- Topics: Professional football\n\nFacts:\n- Dan Lewis was born on 11 December 1902 and was a Welsh football goalkeeper.\n- Dan Lewis was most notable for playing for Arsenal.\n- In the 1927 FA Cup Final, Dan Lewis kept goal for Arsenal, and a mistake by him saw Cardiff City win the cup.\n- Arsenal F.C. is a professional football club based in Highbury, London, England.\n- Arsenal F.C. plays in the Premier League, the top flight of English football.\n- Dan Lewis died in 1965.",
